# Utilities an office workstation needs regardless of which applications it runs.
#
# ROS deliberately ships no third-party browser or office suite. The browser,
# the document tools and the rest of the basic application set are being built
# as ROS applications on open source upstreams and carry ROS's own interface,
# so pulling in Firefox and LibreOffice here would only mean shipping something
# that has to be replaced. See docs/applications.md.
simple-scan
cups
cups-filters
system-config-printer
gnome-remote-desktop
